fact that you can just

00:34:32.929 --> 00:34:36.520
click on Edit and change
things while they're running,

00:34:36.520 --> 00:34:37.604
and everything just works.

00:34:37.604 --> 00:34:38.561
MARK MANDEL: It's fine.

00:34:38.561 --> 00:34:39.350
